.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Explain what this position level set is, and how to get a custom set if your organization needs one.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"
  %p.mb-3
    Titles pick a major level from a set; Positions sit at a minor level under that major. Most orgs never need more than one set.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li The set name (like Base 10x3) is intentionally hidden almost everywhere else — only the Position levels reference page surfaces it for advanced readers.
    %li Custom sets are arranged with your OG representative; there is no self-serve editor here.
    %li The table lists every major band in this set so you can jump to a major’s detail page.
